author ai
group features/gui
note In the Tours tab, press 'new tour' beside the filter: a form opens under it with a name field (it takes the keyboard), the three kinds as buttons (flow chosen), and a group field filled with the group of the tour being read. The reader reaches for it to start a tour while browsing without switching to the CLI (the human builds tours by hand). Press 'create', or enter in either field: the tour is added to the map with that kind and group, authored by the human, and opened empty in the document, which says how to add steps (feature-add-step). The form closes. An empty name keeps the form open and says to type one; an invalid name or one that exists is refused in the status bar. Pressing 'new tour' again closes the form.

